_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000818479-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-26","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000818479","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/818479/000081847926000075/xray-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6db2c807353a73423e333d391abca480b61440b3d4beabd25f58ed9628810233.bin","sha256":"6db2c807353a73423e333d391abca480b61440b3d4beabd25f58ed9628810233"}},{"id":"11e9c76be5dea8dc0e9550b8d298ec9e94bdb893ded15089480494dcab7a1078","quote":"•Continued opportunities in emerging markets related to the rise in discretionary incomes making dental services an increasing priority.","context":"•Increasing demand for aesthetic dentistry and the use of clear aligners as an orthodontic treatment.","section":"Item 1. Business","block":75,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000818479-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-26","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000818479","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/818479/000081847926000075/xray-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6db2c807353a73423e333d391abca480b61440b3d4beabd25f58ed9628810233.bin","sha256":"6db2c807353a73423e333d391abca480b61440b3d4beabd25f58ed9628810233"}},{"id":"1e90b6ed00a8615e7223140cd2483e03ccf7c2e4347040caf3cabba6f4812f59","quote":"•Growing preference for single visit dentistry versus historical multi-visit procedure requirements, and for higher quality of patient care in terms of comfort and ease of product use and handling.","context":"•Continued opportunities in emerging markets related to the rise in discretionary incomes making dental services an increasing priority.","section":"Item 1. Business","block":76,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0000818479-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-26","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0000818479","url